// Two notes regarding data included in the above files:\
a) All control variables originating in data I purchased from the Senegalese National Agency for Statistics and Demography are proprietary and cannot be released. This includes count measures of village-level civic associations and economic activities. Results are consistent without their inclusion.\
b) The GIS data on which the dataset is constructed was graciously shared with me with the understanding that I not distribute it publicly. Accordingly, the data has been scrubbed of village and local government names - replaced with unique identifying numbers - and the village coordinates have been jittered by 0.00XX decimal degrees, the equivalent of about a half kilometer. This does not impact the paper\'92s main results, but does impede the utility of the geographic data for other purposes.}